The bare run is flag-shaped and stays literal: a ---(p) b.\n -> source.carve
\n -> source.carve
The braced form converts wherever it stands: a  -> source.carve
{--} -> source.carve constant.character.entity.typography.carve
(p) b, x -> source.carve
{--} -> source.carve constant.character.entity.typography.carve
y,  -> source.carve
{--} -> source.carve constant.character.entity.typography.carve
start.\n -> source.carve
